<title>TURKEY: Istanbul stock exchange chairman Artun dies.</title>
<headline>Istanbul stock exchange chairman Artun dies.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul Stock Exchange chairman Tuncay Artun died on Wednesday after being admitted to hospital a day earlier, an exchange official said.</p>
<p>&quot;He died at about 8.30 a.m. (0530 GMT),&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Artun was admitted to hospital on Monday night and had been in a coma related to a sharp rise in the level of sugar in his blood, an exchange statement said earlier.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 0875</p>
</text>
